Brand when each face is used
title end

paragraph start
Choose the face by the job of the post, not by mood. Ask one question before each post: what is the viewer meant to feel or do after it. The answer points to one face.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Write one sentence of promise per face and one example post per face. If two faces make the same promise, merge them. If a post fits no face, it belongs under SHAPE.
paragraph end

